{"v":4,"catch":"面對最終的外星入侵者！","desc":"“GALAGA”是 NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment）於 1981 年發行的射擊遊戲。\n它是 GALAXIAN 的續集。 這個標題有一個新的 FIGHTER 模型，帶有快速導彈與邪惡的外星人對抗！\n它還可以讓您營救被 BOSS GALAGA 牽引光束俘獲的 FIGHTERS，以形成雙聯 FIGHTER 進行雙聯導彈射擊。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-01-05","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e1836b7e3ca8e2109f5cf0adc3ecae95d72c20d9903afb155bc58573dfe8100d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/01aa23fa59fa909f55e4bb84fd9bc00b9f0e59909aab588d20dc303971a88864.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5b6484be7b30b5422d02cd42f4b02add1f69878cd3eabec392574a5ec4923212.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/52d0e2b7993ed1f5afb6c6d674a404e5b298d7b8f56554ee6dec3a71815a75d6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/eb574b9e821161dae186322e5fe426fdc1717c63f1e6b39f06fb3f16ae31a8fb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e9283088223a3e8f60a3b816f96e32f0d751a00afde82cf4a942576587f8ba59.jpg"],"titleId":"0100566015ad2000","dlc":[]}